Run PostgreSQL migrations from the repository root:

    uv run alembic -c database/alembic.ini upgrade head

Migrations load the repository root .env file. Existing shell environment
variables take precedence. Set POSTGRES_USER, POSTGRES_PASSWORD, and POSTGRES_DB
in .env or the environment; POSTGRES_HOST and POSTGRES_PORT default to localhost
and 5432. Copy .env.example to .env if needed and configure your local database.
